### ----------------------------------------------------
### PRODUCT ENDPOINTS
### ----------------------------------------------------

### 1. Create Product 1 (MacBook Pro 16")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "MacBook Pro 16-inch M3 Max",
  "description": "Apple M3 Max chip with 16-core CPU, 40-core GPU, 48GB Unified Memory, and 1TB SSD storage. Space Black Liquid Retina XDR display.",
  "price": 89000000,
  "quantity": 15,
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517336714731-489689fd1ca8?w=800"
}

### 2. Create Product 2 (Keychron Keyboard)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Keychron Q1 Pro Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "QMK/VIA wireless custom mechanical keyboard, 75% layout, full CNC machined aluminum body, hot-swappable switches, double-gasket design.",
  "price": 4900000,
  "quantity": 50,
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587829741301-dc798b83add3?w=800"
}

### 3. Create Product 3 (Dell Monitor)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dell UltraSharp 49 Curved Monitor - U4924DW",
  "description": "Dual QHD (5120 x 1440) curved resolution monitor, IPS Black technology, 2000:1 contrast ratio, 90W USB-C power delivery, built-in KVM switch.",
  "price": 29900000,
  "quantity": 10,
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1527443224154-c4a3942d3acf?w=800"
}

### 4. Create Product 4 (Sony Headphones)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sony WH-1000XM5 Wireless Headphones",
  "description": "Industry-leading noise-canceling over-ear headphones, 30-hour battery life, multipoint connection, Alexa built-in, crystal-clear hands-free calling.",
  "price": 8490000,
