### 5. Create Product 5 (Ultimate Masterclass)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ultimate Spring Boot & Stripe Masterclass",
  "description": "Lifetime access to the comprehensive guide on building secure, scalable e-commerce systems using Spring Boot 3, MapStruct, PostgreSQL, and Stripe Elements/Webhooks.",
  "price": 1250000,
  "quantity": 999,
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517694712202-14dd9538aa97?w=800"
}

### 6. Get List of Products (Paginated)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?page=1&size=10

### 7. Get Product by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1


### ----------------------------------------------------
### ORDER ENDPOINTS
### ----------------------------------------------------

### 1. Create Order (Sample 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ],
  "currency": "VND"
}

### 2. Create Order (Sample 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 3,
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "productId": 4,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ],
  "currency": "VND"
}

### 3. Get Order by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1

### 4. Get Order by Code (Replace with actual code from Order creation response)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/code/ORD-XXXXXX


### ----------------------------------------------------
### PAYMENT ENDPOINTS
### ----------------------------------------------------

### 1. Checkout Order (Stripe) (Replace orderCode with actual code from Order creation response)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderCode": "ORD-XXXXXX",
  "paymentGateway": "STRIPE"
}
